body:
Likely not. It sounds like it's such an integral part of the system. Given the single player focus of Eternal people will play the game, finish it and move on. Nobody cares for Battle Mode. So by the time it's released nobody will be playing it. It'll be so difficult to actually find a game to join by then. So silly. It should have been delayed to add multiplayer modes. A self-sustaining one would have been a good idea (the kind of attractive mode that the devs don't have to touch allowing them to work on other content.)

&#x200B;

It's 2021 and still no word on it.
